sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant F as Frontend
  participant A as Auth (Supabase)
  participant DB as Supabase/Postgres

  U->>F: Fill signup form (email, password)
  F->>A: POST /auth/v1/signup
  A->>DB: create auth user
  DB-->>A: auth user created
  A-->>F: 200 OK (session or confirmation)
  F->>DB: (optional) insert profile row via anon or backend
  DB-->>F: profile created
  F-->>U: show welcome / redirect

  note over F,A: Login flow similar: POST /auth/v1/token -> return session
